[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2594421181","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101615#issuecomment-2594421181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101615","id":2594421181,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ao7m9","user":{"login":"Jordyfel","id":76705401,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzA1NDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76705401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordyfel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-16T03:50:43Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T03:56:08Z","body":"Investigated a bit and something weird is going on.\n\nThe bug only happens if both the scene and its script are open. During the filesystem dock move, a scene reload is requested, which ends up asking the script editor to edit the script. When iterating over the already opened scripts in the script editor, the following check for whether the script is already open weirdly fails:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0726d3c7d5125d1a72ec318a2ec4ff11f9f7f8bb/editor/plugins/script_editor_plugin.cpp#L2564\n\nTry setting a breakpoint here and then moving the file, the debugger shows 2 different objects with different pointer addresses and refcounts. The `path_cache` value also differs. The object with the correct path is the one passed to the function, and the wrong path belongs to the object returned by `se->get_edited_resource()`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2594421181/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2595928186","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101615#issuecomment-2595928186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101615","id":2595928186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aurh6","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-16T14:48:34Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T14:48:34Z","body":"It's another regression from #96499\nCC @beev1s","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2595928186/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628606390","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101615#issuecomment-2628606390","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101615","id":2628606390,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6crVm2","user":{"login":"Jordyfel","id":76705401,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzA1NDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76705401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordyfel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-01T00:17:23Z","updated_at":"2025-02-01T01:04:39Z","body":"Investigated some more and I think that PR should be reverted.\n\nIt is difficult to pin down, but it seems that, by sometimes avoiding registration in `ResourceCache`, the scripts end up getting duplicated. Some codepaths assume that scripts will be in the `ResourceCache`, so it doesn't seem like a good idea to occasionally avoid it.\n\nOne of the reasons for duplication seems to be this getting skipped when moving (because the script is not in the `ResourceCache`)\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1586c5674bbafe1d7f4bd457d446f132b475890c/editor/filesystem_dock.cpp#L1560-L1577\n\nThe `set_path()` call would normally update the path in the `GDScriptCache`, but it gets skipped, then if the scene the script is attached to is open, the scene reloads the script, which is not found in the `GDScriptCache` at the new path, then the script gets recompiled and duplicated.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628606390/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]